{"user": "Would B6 be a better move", "user_ts": "2026-08-20T16:51:07.436785+00:00", "assistant": "b6 looks **safer than g2** in one way: it doesn\u2019t immediately sit next to the h1 corner.\n\nBut check the follow-up: after b6, what good moves does White get? In particular, look at edge/corner-related empties like **b8, a7, a3, a1**. If your move gives White a strong edge move or a corner route, flipping a few discs now may not help.\n\nSo: b6 may be better than g2, but I\u2019d still compare it with your other legal edge move before choosing.", "assistant_started_ts": "2026-08-20T16:51:21.103041+00:00", "assistant_ts": "2026-08-20T16:51:23.513996+00:00", "annotation_assistant_fine": {"final": ["Local Justification", "Hint", "Prompt", "Neutral Feedback"], "consensus": ["Local Justification", "Hint", "Prompt", "Neutral Feedback"], "votes": {"Local Justification": 3, "Hint": 3, "Neutral Feedback": 2, "Move Verdict": 1, "Prompt": 2, "General Principle": 1}, "confidence": {"Local Justification": 1.0, "Hint": 1.0, "Neutral Feedback": 0.6666666666666666, "Move Verdict": 0.3333333333333333, "Prompt": 0.6666666666666666, "General Principle": 0.3333333333333333}, "per_model": {"gpt": ["Local Justification", "Hint", "Neutral Feedback"], "llama": ["Move Verdict", "Local Justification", "Hint", "Prompt"], "sonnet": ["Local Justification", "General Principle", "Hint", "Prompt", "Neutral Feedback"]}, "n_valid": 3, "min_votes": 2, "no_majority": false, "needs_review": false, "arbiter_used": false, "coarse": ["Direct Instruction", "Hint", "Prompt", "Neutral Feedback"]}, "annotation_user": {"final": ["Common Ground Question"], "consensus": ["Common Ground Question"], "votes": {"Common Ground Question": 3}, "confidence": {"Common Ground Question": 1.0}, "per_model": {"gpt": ["Common Ground Question"], "sonnet": ["Common Ground Question"], "llama": ["Common Ground Question"]}, "n_valid": 3, "min_votes": 2, "no_majority": false, "needs_review": false, "arbiter_used": false}}
